{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nfrom functools import lru_cache\nimport itertools\n\ndef invnum(seq):\n    N = len(seq)\n    res = 0\n    for i in range(N):\n        for j in range(i+1, N):\n            if seq[i] > seq[j]:\n                res += 1\n    return res\n\ndef naive(N, k, flag):\n    res = 0\n    for p in itertools.permutations(range(N), N):\n        for q in itertools.permutations(range(N), N):\n            if ((p < q) or (not(flag))) and (invnum(p) - invnum(q) > k):\n                res += 1\n    return res\n\nn, mod = map(int, input().split())\n\n# Use memoization with tuple-based keys and precomputed bounds\ndef solve(N, k, flag):\n    # Precompute bounds for this N\n    invnum_INF = (N * (N - 1)) // 2\n    \n    # Handle boundary conditions first\n    if k < -invnum_INF - 1:\n        return solve(N, -invnum_INF - 1, flag)\n    if k >= invnum_INF:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Base case\n    if N == 1:\n        if flag:\n            return 0\n        return 1 if k < 0 else 0\n    \n    # Compute result\n    res = 0\n    for delta in range(-N + 1, N):\n        if flag and delta > 0:\n            continue\n        wt = min(N - delta, delta + N)\n        new_flag = (delta == 0) and flag\n        res += solve(N - 1, k - delta, new_flag) * wt\n        res %= mod\n    \n    return res % mod\n\n# Memoize using dictionary\ncache = {}\ndef solve_cached(N, k, flag):\n    key = (N, k, flag)\n    if key in cache:\n        return cache[key]\n    result = solve(N, k, flag)\n    cache[key] = result\n    return result\n\n# Use the cached version\nans = solve_cached(n, 0, 1) % mod\nprint(ans)\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    private static int mod;\n    private static Map<String, Integer> cache = new HashMap<>();\n\n    private static int solve(int N, int k, boolean flag) {\n        String key = N + \",\" + k + \",\" + flag;\n        if (cache.containsKey(key)) {\n            return cache.get(key);\n        }\n\n        int invnum_INF = (N * (N - 1)) / 2;\n        int result;\n\n        if (k < -invnum_INF - 1) {\n            result = solve(N, -invnum_INF - 1, flag);\n        } else if (k >= invnum_INF) {\n            result = 0;\n        } else if (N == 1) {\n            if (flag) {\n                result = 0;\n            } else {\n                result = (k < 0) ? 1 : 0;\n            }\n        } else {\n            result = 0;\n            for (int delta = -N + 1; delta < N; delta++) {\n                if (flag && delta > 0) {\n                    continue;\n                }\n                int wt = Math.min(N - delta, delta + N);\n                boolean new_flag = (delta == 0) && flag;\n                int subResult = solve(N - 1, k - delta, new_flag);\n                result = (int) ((result + (long) subResult * wt) % mod);\n            }\n        }\n\n        cache.put(key, result);\n        return result;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(Syst